["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"76. 王小川返场谈o1与强化学习：摸到了一条从快思考走向慢思考的路 CoT reward model DIKW Self Play RL scaling law\" href=\"/podcast/p/2024-09-25-zhangxiaojun-o1-不是转弯是进阶-快思考模型学会了慢思考/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/513984cf6692fc8c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">39:05</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0925</span></div>\n<h2>o1 不是转弯是进阶：快思考模型学会了慢思考</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">王小川认为 o1 是范式升级而非进步退两步——先有快思考，才能用强化学习让它学会慢思考，这条路摸到了从语言走向智能的雏形。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>3</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">强化学习</span><span class=\"tag\">o1</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"75. 和OpenAI前研究员吴翼解读o1：吹响了开挖第二座金矿的号角 PPO DQN RLHF self-play Scaling Law\" href=\"/podcast/p/2024-09-18-zhangxiaojun-o1-不是路线转弯-是-agi-梯子又多了几节/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/671dcf2cd1d9802c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:14:10</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0918</span></div>\n<h2>o1 不是路线转弯，是 AGI 梯子又多了几节</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">预训练这座金矿快挖到头了，强化学习是第二座矿。o1 的 preview 更像 GPT-3 时刻，能不能成为 ChatGPT 时刻要看正式版。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>2</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">强化学习</span><span class=\"tag\">o1</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"74. 从蒸汽机到无人驾驶4｜Waymo和它的对手们：我暗中考察了四个月 DARPA Grand Challenge AlexNet 端到端 Moon Shot Project Robotaxi\" href=\"/podcast/p/2024-09-11-zhangxiaojun-waymo-领先不是技术最强-是没犯过大错/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/e35749cd8b4f7e70-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:13:43</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0911</span></div>\n<h2>Waymo 领先不是技术最强，是没犯过大错</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Waymo 起步最早、换过四任负责人、被业内一致看衰，最后却成了 L4 唯一还在引领行业的公司——因为它活了下来，且没犯 Cruise 和 Uber 那种致命错误。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">自动驾驶</span><span class=\"tag\">Waymo</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"73. AGI范式大转移：和广密预言草莓、OpenAI o1和self-play RL｜全球大模型季报4 Self-Play RL Scaling Law reward model RLHF MOE DiT\" href=\"/podcast/p/2024-09-05-zhangxiaojun-不做强化学习的公司-下一波浪潮里可能跑不出来/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/27f4c2e89ae9ca7b-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:27:01</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0905</span></div>\n<h2>不做强化学习的公司，下一波浪潮里可能跑不出来</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">语言预训练遇到瓶颈后，硅谷最核心的几百名研究者已把资源压注到 self-play RL 上，它用推理算力换训练算力，让模型自己探索出逻辑推理能力。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">强化学习</span><span class=\"tag\">AGI</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"71. 和楼天城聊聊Robotaxi和ACRush：“L2做得越厉害，离L4越远” contest based metric system MPX Hold hard end-to-end BEV Robotaxi\" href=\"/podcast/p/2024-08-16-zhangxiaojun-l2做得越好离l4越远-无人驾驶的路线之争/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d093a1c7aa808aa9-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:00:19</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0816</span></div>\n<h2>L2做得越好离L4越远，无人驾驶的路线之争</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">小马智行楼天城认为 L2 和 L4 目标不同：L2 用户只要够用、成本更低，做得越好反而离 L4 越远；L4 要的是万小时不出事，还得有一把评价好坏的尺子。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">自动驾驶</span><span class=\"tag\">Robotaxi</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"70. 和何小鹏聊，FSD、“在血海游泳”、乱世中的英雄与狗熊 AD BOM Robot Taxi OTA\" href=\"/podcast/p/2024-07-16-zhangxiaojun-何小鹏-大模型对小型公司不利-越强越多数据越多费用/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/514c23c30b63a46b-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:27:28</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0716</span></div>\n<h2>何小鹏：大模型对小型公司不利，越强越多数据越多费用</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">大 AI 的网络效应是：越强所以越多数据，越多数据所以越多费用，越多费用所以要卖越多车去支持这个体系。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>2</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">自动驾驶</span><span class=\"tag\">大模型</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"69. 口述全球大模型这半年：Perplexity突然火爆和尚未爆发的AI应用生态 PMF RAG MOE Scaling Law Latency\" href=\"/podcast/p/2024-06-23-zhangxiaojun-ai应用没爆发-不是产品问题是模型问题/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/88869a8f5db7fb1f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:06:43</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0623</span></div>\n<h2>AI应用没爆发，不是产品问题是模型问题</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">GPT-4 出来一年多，硅谷主流 VC 投出的 AI 应用只有 Perplexity 一家跑到 2000 多万月活；90% 的原因是只基于 GPT-4 的能力不够，只能做信息组合，做不了长距离推理。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>3</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 应用</span><span class=\"tag\">Perplexity</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"68. 和MiniMax天使投资人聊，MiniMax幕后故事和大模型资本扑克牌 Club Deal corner cases MOE scale up L4\" href=\"/podcast/p/2024-06-10-zhangxiaojun-minimax-第一位投资人-大厂降价是看牌-创业公司只能认赔/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6400a25bba631a90-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:02:44</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0610</span></div>\n<h2>MiniMax 第一位投资人：大厂降价是看牌，创业公司只能认赔</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">大厂做模型可以不赚钱、从云计算把钱挣回来，创业公司被拖进价格战却无处回血；MiniMax 的解法是模型质量第一，靠海外 2C 产品收钱。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">大模型</span><span class=\"tag\">融资</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"67. 谈谈黄仁勋搭建的组织系统：分布式操作系统，“就像一台GPU” Conway&#x27;s Law context, not control Zero Billion Dollar Market chiplet\" href=\"/podcast/p/2024-05-31-zhangxiaojun-英伟达没有五年计划-黄仁勋把公司做成了一台-gpu/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/f0eed2af727e6cd8-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:14:56</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0531</span></div>\n<h2>英伟达没有五年计划：黄仁勋把公司做成了一台 GPU</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">黄仁勋的八条反常识管理法不是散点，而是一套分布式操作系统：60 个高管直接汇报、薪酬精确到一美分相同、不做一对一、不做计划——组织沟通结构决定了产品架构。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>11</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">组织管理</span><span class=\"tag\">英伟达</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"66. 和李志飞聊IPO、GPT-4o和你不知道的前沿科技创业的痛 VLA DiT In Context Learning codec P&amp;L\" href=\"/podcast/p/2024-05-23-zhangxiaojun-前沿科技创业的痛-上市那天-我觉得对不起这12年/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b6a457f38ae1bd4-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:29:19</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0523</span></div>\n<h2>前沿科技创业的痛：上市那天，我觉得对不起这12年</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">出门问问创始人李志飞说，敲钟那一刻他想的不是荣耀，而是「今天这个结果对得起我12年受的磨难吗——对不起」。他把前沿科技创业的宿命总结成一块随时会化的浮冰。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">前沿科技创业</span><span class=\"tag\">大模型</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"65. 风险投资的钥匙失灵了吗？和梦秋聊：蛰伏、更少人的游戏和啮齿动物 明股实债 check size power law foundation model AI for science AI for coding\" href=\"/podcast/p/2024-04-22-zhangxiaojun-vc-的以小博大逻辑失效了-我们改做侏罗纪的老鼠/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d3a24508c632217d-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:16:59</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0422</span></div>\n<h2>VC 的以小博大逻辑失效了，我们改做侏罗纪的老鼠</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">美元 VC 的募资端和退出端同时被掐断，靠十个 check 里中两三个的杠杆故事讲不下去了。清流资本的选择是：要么投一两年就能变现的现在学，要么投七到十年的未来学，中间地带最难。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">风险投资</span><span class=\"tag\">AI</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"64. 和广密聊AGI大基建时代：电+芯片=产出智能 Scaling Law Agent 主权 AI T5T Killer App\" href=\"/podcast/p/2024-04-17-zhangxiaojun-agi-是马拉松-物理硬件成了最大瓶颈/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/9219795544d999cf-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:21:56</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0417</span></div>\n<h2>AGI 是马拉松：物理硬件成了最大瓶颈</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">去年以为加 GPU 加数据就能到 AGI，今年发现单数据中心加到 3.2 万卡就撞墙，美国能源基建还是四五十年前规划的——AGI 时间表被物理世界拖长了。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AGI</span><span class=\"tag\">算力</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"62. 你们要的朱啸虎，来了 PMF Llama POC C2C 视频电话\" href=\"/podcast/p/2024-04-01-zhangxiaojun-朱啸虎-中国-aigc-应用已经大爆发-只是都藏在-to-b-里/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/4a9e53f96035921e-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">52:14</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0401</span></div>\n<h2>朱啸虎：中国 AIGC 应用已经大爆发，只是都藏在 to B 里</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">朱啸虎说中国 AIGC 应用已经大爆发，只是都发生在企业服务里：外卖意外险赔付率从 150 块降到 60 块，视频面试一年做到 100 万人次，消费者根本看不见。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AIGC</span><span class=\"tag\">风险投资</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"59. 和杨植麟聊大模型创业这一年：人类理想的增量、有概率的非共识和Sora scaling law long context PMF DiT next token prediction\" href=\"/podcast/p/2024-03-01-zhangxiaojun-杨植麟-模型公司是炼油厂-值钱的是化工厂和汽车公司/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d78d1766eee1289a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:20:00</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0301</span></div>\n<h2>杨植麟：模型公司是炼油厂，值钱的是化工厂和汽车公司</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">商业史上第一波跑出来的公司几乎从不是下个阶段的赢家。模型公司是提炼基础油的炼油厂，真正值钱的是化工厂和汽车公司——所以月之暗面只做 to C，且只做 to C。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">大模型</span><span class=\"tag\">AGI</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"58. 和吴晓波聊中国企业家小史：如果未来没有大生意，年轻人不如过自己喜欢的人生 越级创业 匠人型企业家 企业家经济\" href=\"/podcast/p/2024-02-01-zhangxiaojun-未来可能没有大生意-年轻人不如过自己喜欢的人生/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/f9079ebf8b858216-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">41:37</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0201</span></div>\n<h2>未来可能没有大生意，年轻人不如过自己喜欢的人生</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">吴晓波把改革开放后的创业者分成六波，第六波最奇怪：高速发展结束、市场饱和、这一代是有产阶级的孩子。他判断未来大部分创业是小创业，AI 有通吃性，不会带来所有人的机会。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">企业家</span><span class=\"tag\">创业</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"57. 《繁花》真实版上海90年代：充满危险气息的黄河路和股市 T加3 认购证 举牌 打庄模子\" href=\"/podcast/p/2024-01-27-zhangxiaojun-繁花-里的宝瀛大战-原型是一场违规收购/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/4d68467a8e18cd21-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:13:32</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0127</span></div>\n<h2>《繁花》里的宝瀛大战，原型是一场违规收购</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">1993年深圳宝安用三家分公司各买4.5%的延中实业，合计16%才举牌，规避5%公告线。证监会罚款100万，却仍认定收购有效——延中实业真的被买走了。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">上海股市</span><span class=\"tag\">繁花</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"55. 与小Lin的线下活动｜不可控周期中，提高微小个体的生命质量 non-farm payroll Content Marketing hikikomori\" href=\"/podcast/p/2024-01-05-zhangxiaojun-你羡慕的大佬都是幸存者-九成创业公司活不过三年/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/280eb7bf594893db-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">55:25</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0105</span></div>\n<h2>你羡慕的大佬都是幸存者，九成创业公司活不过三年</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">小Lin说大佬的共性是「胆」，敢担风险。但这是幸存者视角：创业九成的公司活不过三年，跑出来的人承担的风险被高光遮住了。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">内容创作</span><span class=\"tag\">投行</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"53. 从萨特曼的宏大叙事，聊到赴中东掘金的中国人肖像 PIF Z-Line family sector\" href=\"/podcast/p/2023-12-24-zhangxiaojun-中东不是风口-是正在上升的长期力量/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/08c7382c7eadd89c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:05:17</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1224</span></div>\n<h2>中东不是风口，是正在上升的长期力量</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">中东的宏大叙事不是中国式全民创业的狂热，而是各国人奔着共同机会聚在一起；中国公司靠高效、灵活和定制化切入，但性价比不是首选，符合国家战略才是。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>3</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">中东出海</span><span class=\"tag\">全球化</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"52.【职场人性】论嫉妒：人类最禁忌的情感，在职场里暗涌 up or out 四元框架 Workplace Envy break winner\" href=\"/podcast/p/2023-12-15-zhangxiaojun-嫉妒无法被消除-只会换个地方重新长出来/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/091a698723799fa8-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:20:13</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1215</span></div>\n<h2>嫉妒无法被消除，只会换个地方重新长出来</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">你消掉一个引起嫉妒的偏差，人立刻会发明另一个——因为嫉妒的底层是分层，而分层是动物性的、消不掉的。好组织不是消灭嫉妒，是把拉别人下来的能量改成把自己拉上去。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">职场人性</span><span class=\"tag\">组织管理</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"51. 地缘政治与大国汽车：中国跃居第一出口国？别浪费大危机 CKD/SKD TPS CVCC 年余效应\" href=\"/podcast/p/2023-12-11-zhangxiaojun-中国汽车出口第一-但日本车企的出海课还没上完/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/77046da3d5a1614f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:18:16</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1211</span></div>\n<h2>中国汽车出口第一，但日本车企的出海课还没上完</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">中国2023年出口441万辆跃居全球第一，但2012到2020年八年出口总量一直卡在每年100万台。日本车企50年代第一次出海美国惨败，靠70年代石油危机才翻身——危机是机会，但政治风险和经济风险同等重要。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">汽车出海</span><span class=\"tag\">地缘政治</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"50. 95后、00后创业者怎么样了？他们的生猛、高马斯克值与现实 SIGGRAPH mesh PMF MVP Citation\" href=\"/podcast/p/2023-12-07-zhangxiaojun-95后创业者把马斯克值拉满-但偶像其实是毛主席/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/f5167f7df8bbfd36-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:14:08</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1207</span></div>\n<h2>95后创业者把马斯克值拉满，但偶像其实是毛主席</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">这波年轻创业者的驱动力不是钱，而是「这东西牛逼就先做」；他们不写BP、不刷榜、不主动做PR，只在意的圈子里积累reputation。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>10</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI创业</span><span class=\"tag\">AIGC</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"48. OpenAI的权力游戏：脸谱、硅谷精英政治与讽刺意味 alignment nerdy AB 票机制 OpenAI LP\" href=\"/podcast/p/2023-11-21-zhangxiaojun-openai-政变-非营利董事会为何能踢走-ceo/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/3d2ee30a56796488-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:06:50</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1121</span></div>\n<h2>OpenAI 政变：非营利董事会为何能踢走 CEO</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">一个 700 人、成立不到 5 年的公司，6 人非营利董事会行使一次权力就干成了政变——而它最大的股东微软连董事会成员都不是。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>13</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">OpenAI</span><span class=\"tag\">公司治理</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"47. 接班百亿基金的琐碎小事：徐小平和他的门徒 IC sourcing carry principal lateral hire imposter\" href=\"/podcast/p/2023-11-16-zhangxiaojun-真格交接-徐小平退场后-合伙人收不了年轻人的税/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/498f3b318cf5e723-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:21:43</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1116</span></div>\n<h2>真格交接：徐小平退场后，合伙人收不了年轻人的税</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">真格用全员 sourcing 和项目个人 ownership 对抗初代优势的消失——每个 logo 只挂一个人名下，合伙人不能靠决策养尊处优。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">风投</span><span class=\"tag\">真格基金</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"46. 失去逍遥子的第一个双十一：诡计、大混战与小阳谋 shopping mall 海景房 SK 商家\" href=\"/podcast/p/2023-11-11-zhangxiaojun-双十一没有逍遥子-平台在分蛋糕-商家在赔本/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7e8cca90f911c8b6-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:25:04</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1111</span></div>\n<h2>双十一没有逍遥子：平台在分蛋糕，商家在赔本</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">双十一的复杂不是设计出来的，是几十条行业线各自往一个 APP 上叠玩法叠出来的；平台拿走约一半，商家一年几十亿盘子只剩几百万利润。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">电商</span><span class=\"tag\">双十一</span>\n</div></div></a>"]